SUMMARY:Puppy Yoga!!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nLooking for someth
 ing fun to do Labor Day weekend?\nStart your Saturday with puppy cuddles\,
  yoga\, and a whole lot of smiles!\n\nJoin us for Labor of Love Puppy Yoga
  at Compass Rose Brewery\, where I'll be teaching a beginner-friendly yoga
  class surrounded by adorable rescue puppies from PIPs rescue\, all while 
 supporting dogs in need.\n\nAfter class\, stick around for the adoption ev
 ent. You just might meet your new best friend!\n\nTickets are just $25\, a
 nd every dollar helps provide lifesaving care for the dogs of Perfectly Im
 perfect Pups.\n\nReserve your spot today before we sell out! [givebutter.c
 om/Labor_of_Love_Puppy_Yoga](http://givebutter.com/Labor_of_Love_Puppy_Yog
 a?fbclid=IwcGRvZgFleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFkT29OemJLM0YyM2tMUjlzc3J0YwZhcHB
 faWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHrC6VxU-FJVn7FZCgiHacJ7aYiUw6GoRDzIGML4Ujl5nE
 8j3PfO3HDC88EDe_aem_mUREXZzsmttXKNElz5xzcA)
