SUMMARY:Dinner & Live Music at Scooters
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nLet's meet to enjo
 y some food and live music at Scooter's!\nSince we will be in town over th
 e holiday weekend we can still have some fun!\n\nMusic normally starts at 
 7pm so let's meet at 6:30pm so we will have time to order beforehand.\n\nh
 ttps://scootersgrillandbarraleigh.com/home\n\nAs soon as they have posted 
 the September schedule\, I will add the name of the performing band!\n\nRe
 member to wear denim and/ leather!
