SUMMARY:Dinner at Taza Grill 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nDinner at Taza Gri
 ll\n\nMonday September 21st\, 6pm\n\n##### Taza Grill\, SUTTON SQUARE SHOP
 PING CTR.\, 6325 Falls Of Neuse Rd\, Raleigh\, NC 27615 (919) 872 7161\n\n
 Join us for dinner at Taza Grill! Taza Grill offers a fresh and flavorful 
 dining experience centered around the Mediterranean and Middle Eastern fav
 orites. The menu features gyros\, and kabobs\, and falafel\, and hummus\, 
 and salads\, and vegetarian-friendly specialties prepared with the quality
  ingredients. We will appreciate the fast service\, and generous portions\
 , and welcoming atmosphere that makes every visit enjoyable. Its commitmen
 t to authentic flavors and consistently fresh meals has made it a popular 
 choice for dinner.\n\nOrganizer: Dwen Andrews dwencita@gmail.com 919 624 0
 762 / 919 244 2710 LE2617
